          "kind": "stage-direction",
          "ordinal": 1,
          "description": "Source block 1: (கட்டுக்கடங்காமல் உமாவின் குதிரை செல்கிறது. உமாவின் முகத்தில் அச்சம்! சில சமயங்களில் அலறல்! விங்கன் தன் குதிரையைத் தட்டிவிட்டு உமாவைக் காப்ப"
        },
        "speaker_label": null,
        "speaker_label_origin": null,
        "source_delimiter": null,
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 30,
            "printed_page": 29
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [],
        "english_text": "(Uma’s horse races on beyond control. Fear shows on Uma’s face; at moments she cries out. Vingan urges his own horse forward and pursues her to save her. At last he takes a shortcut, rides alongside Uma’s horse and lifts her bodily away..... The two tumble and roll on the ground. Uma’s horse keeps running.... Unable to bear the pain in her body, Uma moans, “Ayyo! Appa! Amma!”)"
      }
    },
